id: divine-apparel
name: Divine Apparel
kind: crafting
# A Special Apparel Quality: "typically gained through your ARC granting you unique pieces of
# Apparel".
special: true
slots: 1
# "Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT)" - this piece's, wherever its Bonus is read.
apparelBonus: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Apparel Bonus 1(bT) higher.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT).
text: >
  Divine Apparel: This article of clothing is empowered by a divine entity.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Increase your Apparel Bonus by 1(bT).

---

# The piece's own Bonus, shown on its sheet 1(bT) higher - and read so by everything that reads
# it: the Armor's Damage Reduction, a Doff Bonus, Parrying Armor, Combat Ready, Spiked.
